WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.278 --> 00:00:01.461
- Andrew, I'd like to introduce you

00:00:01.461 --> 00:00:03.899
to our new employee, Gaby.

00:00:06.021 --> 00:00:09.658
(loud sniffing)

00:00:10.992 --> 00:00:12.176
- Nice to meet you.

00:00:12.176 --> 00:00:14.273
- So good to see you, man.

00:00:17.236 --> 00:00:20.804
("Ranz des Vaches" by Rossini)

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:26.605
- Certainly your performance could've been

00:00:26.605 --> 00:00:31.252
Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:00:32.363 --> 00:00:34.059
It's not the worst.

00:00:34.617 --> 00:00:37.311
- Did someone eat my fortune cookie?

00:00:37.311 --> 00:00:39.423
Andrew?

00:00:39.423 --> 00:00:41.078
Andrew, that was my cookie!

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:43.680
- Hey.

00:00:44.573 --> 00:00:46.427
- [Andrew] Wanna play?

00:00:50.831 --> 00:00:52.212
- Andrew, you can have a seat.

00:01:00.409 --> 00:01:05.345
- Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:01:05.345 --> 00:01:06.321
Hey?

00:01:06.321 --> 00:01:08.788
Hey, can I have some of that?

00:01:08.788 --> 00:01:10.251
- Of my food? No.

00:01:10.251 --> 00:01:11.621
- Can I have some of that?

00:01:11.621 --> 00:01:12.580
- No.

00:01:18.502 --> 00:01:20.267
- Not now, Andrew.

00:01:31.403 --> 00:01:32.937
(groans deeply)

00:01:38.051 --> 00:01:41.725
(loud sniffing)

